test_purpose:
(1)

with { UE supporting location-based measurements in NR RRC_IDLE state on a cell which provides
access by NR NTN }
ensure that {

  when { Sintrasearch is non-zero in system information and distance between UE and the serving cell

referenceLocation is larger than distanceThresh }
          then { UE performs intra-frequency measurements and reselects the highest ranked cell up on

Srxlev > SIntraSearchP }
                     }

(2)

with { UE supporting location-based measurements in NR RRC_IDLE state on a cell which provides
access by NR NTN }
ensure that {

  when { Snonintrasearch is non-zero in system information and distance between UE and the serving cell reference

location referenceLocation is larger than distanceThresh }
          then { UE performs inter-frequency measurements and reselects the cell which belong to the

lower priority frequency upon Srxlev > Snonintrasearch }

                     }
